Source: mod-host-protocol
Section: libs
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Pau Aliagas <linuxnow@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3, pkgconf
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/linuxnow/mod-host
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: libmod-host-protocol0
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: mod-host socket server, line protocol and command dispatch
 The socket server, the line protocol and the command dispatch of mod-host,
 without any plugin format behind them, as a shared library. Hosts that answer
 mod-host's protocol with a plugin backend of their own, such as omx-clap-host
 and plugin-hostd, link it.

Package: libmod-host-protocol-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmod-host-protocol0 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: mod-host protocol library, development files
 Headers, the pkg-config file and the backend scenarios of libmod-host-protocol,
 for hosts that answer mod-host's protocol with their own plugin backend.
